{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1107297-rip-stewart-wieck","id":1107297,"title":"RIP Stewart Wieck","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-24T06:58:11-07:00","id":1107297,"title":"RIP Stewart Wieck","content":"Stewart Wieck, cofounder of White Wolf and one of the creators of WoD and Mage: the Ascension, has just passed away.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.tenkarstavern.com/2017/06/stewart-wieck-has-passed-white-wolf.html?m=1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJf8BBaWkrcjeg-yOYrnZ7yGqLCMey19BNTMyTP_TWtHKW8pnLf5dH9EWa0ij3W3KVrGPu08A7BKxQ2nibuKTqcegrygOIKekq6EMcnhf7B73K5uS5y3oeD2QnQ6rpPMPJuQxaYM8C-l5d/s400/Screenshot+2018-10-12+10.24.13.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.tenkarstavern.com/2017/06/stewart-wieck-has-passed-white-wolf.html?m=1\" target=\"_blank\"> Stewart Wieck has Passed (White Wolf) </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.tenkarstavern.com/2017/06/stewart-wieck-has-passed-white-wolf.html?m=1\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.tenkarstavern.com/2017/06/stewart-wieck-has-passed-white-wolf.html?m=1 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> A blog focused on OSR gaming, the Swords &amp; Wizardry RPG and all things Dungeons &amp; Dragons.Tavern Chat is the accompanying Podcast. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-24T10:03:18-07:00","id":1107345,"title":"","content":"He was one of the greats at White Wolf back in the early days and I do love his work for White Wolf back in the 90's.<br /> <br /> \u200bHe will be greatly missed and I give his friends and family my utmost condolences.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-24T15:28:42-07:00","id":1107429,"title":"","content":"One of the greats in this industry. World of Darkness fans(of which I'm one of) owe him a great deal for the joy he's brought us over the years. In reality, he changed my life for the better.<br /> <br /> My prayers are with his family.<br /> <br /> R.I.P. Mr. Wieck.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-24T15:44:15-07:00","id":1107431,"title":"","content":"&quot;Do you not know that a man is not dead while his name is still spoken?&quot; - Terry Pratchett <br /> <br /> Fair journey. You helped me believe in magic, Stewart Wieck. I hope to meet you someday, somewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-24T16:58:00-07:00","id":1107448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fat Larry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1107297-rip-stewart-wieck?p=1107429#post1107429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the greats in this industry. World of Darkness fans(of which I'm one of) owe him a great deal for the joy he's brought us over the years. In reality, he changed my life for the better.<br /> <br /> My prayers are with his family.<br /> <br /> R.I.P. Mr. Wieck.</div> </div> </div> </div>The same for me. I met my best friend during a Vampire: the Masquerade game and got to know my wife during a game of Mage: the Ascension. If there was never a World of Darkness, my life would have turned out dramatically different. <br /> <br /> It's really amazing how many lives that a person like Stewart Wieck can touch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-24T22:54:50-07:00","id":1107525,"title":"","content":"He has done some amazing work for gaming and he'll be sorely missed.<br /> <br /> My thoughts are with his family.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2367,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","user":"Resplendent Fire","date":". 06-25-2017, 02:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-25T00:37:48-07:00","id":1107563,"title":"","content":"It's not an exaggeration to say that without WoD, my professional and personal life would've been very different. What a devastating loss...<br /> <br /> I thought this was very well said: <a href=\"https://satyrosphilbrucato.wordpress.com/2017/06/25/stewart-wieck-awakening-our-world/\" target=\"_blank\">https://satyrosphilbrucato.wordpress...ing-our-world/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum